==Description==
The '''XmasLights Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained from [[Krampus' Revenge Event#Krampus' Revenge Season Pass|Krampus' Revenge Season]] at Rank 2, which requires {{Cookies|200}} or {{Robux|30}} total.

The '''XmasLights Nametag''' has green text with multiple flashing colored lights on it.

